      "3a70971a",
      "Categorized Notes",
      "On the note section at a button does a pop-up dialogue window allows me to manage my categories add, create, edit or delete them.\n\nBack on the main note creation/editing window dialogue, Allow me to select a category for the note to be under otherwise it's under uncategorized.\n\nOn the main note view, put a horizontally scrolling tool bar with tabs to switch tabs for your categories by default it will show all notes but you can filter them by selecting your category.",
