      "624a6bf9",
      "I Love This Template",
      "This is a beautiful template. It's lightweight it's smooth it's compact and doesn't have unnecessarily large UI is exactly the right size. \n\nI want to build a web framework library off of it. But the first thing I want you to do is I want you to first extract the CSS and create me template which only has a single page on it which is empty and a system page which is also empty it's a system page rest at the bottom inside bar but the navigation link. \n\n2. You can send me that template in CSSC as soon as you're done and we will move on to improving this app",
