      "0672a1b7",
      "Enhanced Task Management",
      "So I want the task manager list to remain looking exactly as it does now it looks very nice. I want you to make it so that I can click or tap a task on the list and it will expand and show a new input section where I can actually describe the details thoroughly of each individual task. Tapping or clicking the header should collapse it again all items should be collapsed by default.",
